-- title:
--   Tₚ on parabolic cohomology lies in the T_ℓ algebra
-- statement:
--   Fix a natural number $M$ with $M \neq 0$, a finite set $S \subseteq \mathbb{N}$, and a prime $p$ with $p \nmid M$. Write $\Gamma =$ [`CohCarrier.GammaH M ⊤`](def/CohCarrier_Level.html#L133), the subgroup of $\mathrm{SL}_2(\mathbb{Z})$ obtained as the image under the inclusion of $\Gamma_0(M)$ of the preimage of the full subgroup $\top \le (\mathbb{Z}/M)^\times$ under [`CohCarrier.gamma0Units`](def/CohCarrier_Level.html#L121), so $\Gamma = \Gamma_0(M)$; write $H^1 =$ [`CohCarrier.H1 M ⊤ ℂ`](def/CohCarrier_Level.html#L162) for the additive homomorphisms $\mathrm{Additive}\,\Gamma \to \mathbb{C}$, and let $V =$ [`ModularCurve.Period.parabolicHoms ℂ Γ ℂ`](def/ModularCurve_PeriodMap.html#L62) be the $\mathbb{C}$-submodule of those $\varphi \in H^1$ with $\varphi(\gamma) = 0$ for every $\gamma \in \Gamma$ whose matrix trace satisfies $\mathrm{tr}(\gamma)^2 = 4$. Let $T_p$ be a $\mathbb{C}$-linear endomorphism of $V$ which is assumed to be induced by the transfer Hecke operator [`CohCarrier.heckeT M ⊤ p ℂ`](def/CohCarrier_Level.html#L250) on $H^1$, in the sense that for every $v \in V$ the homomorphism underlying $T_p v$ equals [`CohCarrier.heckeT M ⊤ p ℂ`](def/CohCarrier_Level.html#L250) applied to the homomorphism underlying $v$. The conclusion is that $T_p$ belongs to the $\mathbb{C}$-subalgebra of $\mathrm{End}_{\mathbb{C}}(V)$ generated by the set of those endomorphisms $T$ of $V$ for which there is a prime $\ell \notin S$ with $\ell \nmid M$ such that $T$ is likewise induced by [`CohCarrier.heckeT M ⊤ ℓ ℂ`](def/CohCarrier_Level.html#L250) on every $v \in V$.
--
--   This is the statement that on the parabolic cohomology of $\Gamma_0(M)$ with complex coefficients, the Hecke operator at one good prime lies in the algebra generated by the Hecke operators at the good primes outside an arbitrary finite exceptional set; the case of the full subgroup $H = (\mathbb{Z}/M)^\times$. It feeds the construction of a polynomial expression for Hecke eigenvalues on parabolic cohomology in [`CohCarrier.exists_mvPolynomial_heckeT_eigenvalue_of_mem_parabolicHoms_gammaH_top`](thm.html#CohCarrier.exists_mvPolynomial_heckeT_eigenvalue_of_mem_parabolicHoms_gammaH_top).
